* Fuzz di/dt chain (transient)
.param Mut=1u
.param Inorm=14
.param Ifault=0

* LM358-like: 1 MHz GBW, internal node clamped to the 0.02..1.8 V output range
.subckt LM358m inp inn out
G1 0 x inp inn 1m
Rp x 0 100Meg
Cp x 0 {1/(2*pi*1k*1Meg)}
Bcl x 0 I=0.1*(max(V(x)-1.8,0)+min(V(x)-0.02,0))
E1 out 0 x 0 1
.ends

Vcc vcc 0 3.3

* Load current (1 V = 1 A): 14 A peak 50 Hz, plus a fast fault ramp at 30 ms
Bi i 0 V={Inorm}*sin(2*pi*50*time)+if(time>30m, min((time-30m)/50u,1)*Ifault, 0)

* Coil EMF = -Mut * di/dt
Bemf emf 0 V=-{Mut}*ddt(V(i))
R_in1 emf m 10k

* U3A leaky integrator
X1 0 m integ LM358m
C_int1 m integ 1n
R_fb1 m integ 1Meg

* U3B comparator, reference 1.65 V from the divider
R_div1 vcc ref 10k
R_div2 ref 0 10k
X2 ref integ dout LM358m

.step param Ifault list 0 50 200
.tran 0 40m 0 2u
.end